Z||000004||theogre||08-20-2001||10:05 PM||||I like the look of the sanyo better. They both have the same problem as most other units.... the controls are too small. <P>Even the stock radios are kind of awkward to use at times because of where they mount. I can't imagine trying to hit those tiny buttons above while driving. They keep shoving more crap into "radios" with no thought about how you use one while driving. <P>Some of the remote jobs are better. At least those let you get the major controls where you can reach them easy.||||reg||1
