Z||000009||Master_Sushi||08-21-2001||09:14 PM||||I would never buy a Jensen product again. I have a basic cheap 120$ single din Jensen cd player in my fiero. When its cold it won't play at all, so in winter I basicly can't use cds in my car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">. Also, my dad put a similar Jensen in his Saab (you can see the Saab in my sig) and that thing was so bad with bumps, you couldn't even play a cd while driving the car! And this was with a big luxury car suspention! This cd player was taken back and replaced with a pioneer that never skips. I'm going to put something nicer in my fiero once I can afford to get rid of the POS in it now.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>------------------<BR>88 Fiero Coupe...<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mesopotamis_1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Master_Sushi (edited 08-21-2001).]||||reg||1
