Z||000013||sqoach||08-22-2001||02:56 PM||||I like the looks of the Jensen. It's pretty  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Only problem is, they always seem to make them CD <I>and</I> cassette, so that jacks up the price. I don't use cassettes at all. I hate when they do that.<BR>I use to have a din-sized Jensen CD receiver in my Fiero. It was pretty cheap ($130). Except for the volume/selector knob thingie that messed up, it worked perfectly for whole time I had it. Didn't skip much. I should've mounted it in better.<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <P>84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR>86 SC (FOR SALE)<BR>86 SE V6 (new project)||||reg||1
